<title>PORTUGAL: Sonae Investimentos H1 96 cons net 3.3 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Sonae Investimentos H1 96 cons net 3.3 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to June 30:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Cons net 3.3 vs 6.3</p>
<p>Note - Sonae Investimentos is Portugal's biggest industrial group. Its 6.3 billion escudo consolidated net profit in the first half of 1995 included a 3.9 billion escudo extraordinary profit from the sale of its stake in Banco Portugues do Atlantico, purchased by Banco Comercial Portugues in March 1995.</p>
